Derived material:

- Detection pattern text and analyzer semantics re-expressed in Go in this
  module (SK-P* rules; each records its upstream rule ID in Origin).
- Test fixtures under testdata/upstream/, copied verbatim from upstream
  tests/fixtures/.

Upstream does not ship a NOTICE file; this file serves as the required
attribution.

This module carries its own copy of the attribution because it is a separate
Go module: a consumer who resolves it on its own never sees the repository
root's NOTICE. The root NOTICE remains authoritative for the repository as a
whole; the two describe the same derived material.
